      "text": "For routine questions for the clinic or surgeon, leave a message on the nursing line at 415-353-2148. The UCSF page says you should get a call within 12 hours. If no one calls, call again. For an emergency, call 415-476-1000 and ask for the Otolaryngology resident on call."
    }
